         "label": "module_1",
         "name": "module_1",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px\">Private label gets you to market in weeks. Custom formulation gets you a moat.</h2><p>Most brands launch with private label. It's the fastest path to market and the lowest-risk way to validate audience and channel. As brands scale, some develop signature products that need proprietary formulations: a unique blend, a specific delivery format, an ingredient combination that doesn't exist elsewhere.</p><p>Our R&D team can develop those for you. The trade-off is timeline (6 to 12 months for full development), minimums (significantly higher than private label), and shared development cost. But the result is yours: a proprietary product that competitors cannot copy from our catalog.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading_size": 32,
          "max_width": 810,
