          "content": "<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You have an established brand with proven private label momentum</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Your customers are asking for something that does not exist in our catalog</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You have validated audience and channel demand for a specific product</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You want a moat against competitors copying your hero SKU</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin